---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="U&I Fellowship \u2014 Program Design & Recruitment Operations \u2014 Shailly" description="Independent work sample: a fellowship recruitment and operating model covering a venue partnership proposal, leadership structure, recruitment operating system, coordination framework, and timelines." path="/work/samples/ui-fellowship-presentation/" ogType="article" ogTitle="U&I Fellowship \u2014 Program Design & Recruitment Operations \u2014 Shailly">
  <article>
    <header class="case-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <nav class="breadcrumb mono" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/work/">Selected Work</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span>Work sample 02</span>
        </nav>

        <div class="page-head-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="mono case-cat">Work sample 02 &middot; Independent presentation</p>
            <h1>Program Design &amp; Recruitment Operations</h1>
            <p class="sample-sub">A fellowship program&rsquo;s recruitment and operating model: venue partnership, leadership structure, operating system, coordination, and timelines.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="head-fact reveal">
            <span class="mono">Context</span>
            <dl>
              <dt class="mono">Label</dt>
              <dd>Independent presentation created as part of a hiring process.</dd>
              <dt class="mono">Status</dt>
              <dd>Proposal &mdash; not an implemented program.</dd>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="meta-strip reveal">
        <div class="meta-cell"><span class="k">Type</span><span class="v">Independent work sample</span></div>
        <div class="meta-cell"><span class="k">Focus</span><span class="v">Program design &amp; recruitment operations</span></div>
        <div class="meta-cell"><span class="k">Format</span><span class="v">Presentation</span></div>
        <div class="meta-cell"><span class="k">Status</span><span class="v">Proposal</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="cs-section">
      <div class="wrap cs-grid">
        <div class="cs-label"><span class="n">01</span><h2>The work</h2></div>
        <div class="cs-body">
          <p class="lead">This presentation explored how a fellowship program could structure its recruitment and operating model.</p>
          <p>The work included a venue partnership proposal, recruitment leadership structure, recruitment operating system, coordination framework, recruitment and training timelines, and recruitment principles.</p>

          <div class="deck-grid">
            <div class="slide">
              <div class="slide-top mono"><span>Operating model</span><span>01</span></div>
              <h3>Recruitment operating system</h3>
              <div class="slide-flow">
                <span>Source</span><i aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</i><span>Screen</span><i aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</i><span>Select</span><i aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</i><span>Train</span>
              </div>
              <p class="slide-note mono">Pipeline &middot; ownership &middot; handoffs</p>
            </div>

            <div class="slide">
              <div class="slide-top mono"><span>People</span><span>02</span></div>
              <h3>Recruitment leadership structure</h3>
              <div class="slide-tree" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="node node--top">Recruitment lead</span>
                <span class="tree-row"><span class="node">Sourcing</span><span class="node">Screening</span><span class="node">Training</span></span>
              </div>
              <p class="slide-note mono">Roles &middot; decision rights &middot; escalation</p>
            </div>

            <div class="slide">
              <div class="slide-top mono"><span>Coordination</span><span>03</span></div>
              <h3>Coordination framework</h3>
              <div class="slide-grid-lines" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
              <p class="slide-note mono">Meetings &middot; reporting &middot; follow-ups</p>
            </div>

            <div class="slide">
              <div class="slide-top mono"><span>Time</span><span>04</span></div>
              <h3>Recruitment &amp; training timelines</h3>
              <div class="slide-timeline" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="tl-phase" style="--w:34%">Recruit</span>
                <span class="tl-phase" style="--w:26%">Screen</span>
                <span class="tl-phase" style="--w:40%">Train</span>
              </div>
              <p class="slide-note mono">Phases &middot; dependencies &middot; readiness</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="ig-note mono">Reconstructed structure previews, not screenshots of the original deck.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cs-section">
      <div class="wrap cs-grid">
        <div class="cs-label"><span class="n">02</span><h2>What it covers</h2></div>
        <div class="cs-body">
          <div class="fw-step"><span class="mono">Venue partnership</span><strong>A proposal for how a venue partner could support delivery.</strong></div>
          <div class="fw-step"><span class="mono">Recruitment leadership</span><strong>Who owns sourcing, screening, selection, and training.</strong></div>
          <div class="fw-step"><span class="mono">Operating system</span><strong>The end-to-end recruitment pipeline and its handoffs.</strong></div>
          <div class="fw-step"><span class="mono">Coordination</span><strong>How the team stays aligned across phases.</strong></div>
          <div class="fw-step"><span class="mono">Timelines</span><strong>Recruitment and training phases, sequenced.</strong></div>
          <div class="fw-step"><span class="mono">Principles</span><strong>The standards the process should hold itself to.</strong></div>
          <p style="margin-top:1.4rem">This was a proposal, not an implemented program. U&amp;I did not adopt these recommendations, and the work is presented as a demonstration of program design thinking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="next-project" aria-label="Next document">
        <div>
          <span class="mono np-label">Next / Organisational documentation</span>
          <a href="/work/samples/volunteer-agreement/"><span class="np-title">Volunteer Agreement &rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/work/">All selected work <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
